silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_01_thesis_concrete_anchor_3_C#mittensvetrecordpresheafanchornode3 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordPresheafAnchorNode3 is the source-schema object C of the Mittens vet-record category, concretely the time-point visit_2 of Mittens' second weekly check-up. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'C', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
